```c
out_size = in_size * 1.5;
out_buf = flb_sds_create_size(out_size);
...
while (1) {
    ret = flb_msgpack_to_json(out_buf, out_size, root);
    if (ret <= 0) {
        tmp_buf = flb_sds_increase(out_buf, 256);
        if (tmp_buf) {
            out_buf = tmp_buf;
            out_size += 256;
        }
        ...
    }
    else {
        break;
    }
}
```

Wait, `flb_sds_increase(out_buf, 256)` increases the sds by 256 bytes. But `out_size` is the logical size. After increase, `out_size += 256`. So `out_size` matches the new sds capacity. OK.

